- if empty?
  .px-5.py-10.text-center.text-sm.text-stone-500
    | Aucun solde à afficher : aucun compte de trésorerie n'est encore ancré sur un relevé ou un comptage.

- else
  .overflow-x-auto data-controller="balance-chart" data-balance-chart-points-value=hover_points.to_json
    svg role="img" aria-label=description viewBox="0 0 #{width} #{height}" preserveAspectRatio="xMinYMin meet" style="min-width: 560px; width: 100%; height: auto;" data-balance-chart-target="svg" data-action="pointermove->balance-chart#track pointerleave->balance-chart#hide"
      title = title
      desc = description
      - grid_lines.each do |graduation|
        line x1=axis_width y1=graduation[:y] x2=width y2=graduation[:y] stroke="#e7e5e4" stroke-width="1"
        text x=(axis_width - 8) y=(graduation[:y] + 4) text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="#78716c"
          = graduation[:label]
      - if dips_below_zero?
        line x1=axis_width y1=zero_y x2=width y2=zero_y stroke=negative_color stroke-width="1"
      - month_ticks.each do |tick|
        text x=tick[:x] y=(baseline + 16) text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#57534e"
          = tick[:label]
      line x1=today_x y1=8 x2=today_x y2=baseline stroke="#a8a29e" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 3"
      text x=(today_x + 4) y=12 font-size="11" fill="#57534e" aujourd'hui
      - if history_path
        polyline points=history_path fill="none" stroke=line_color stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"
      - if projection_path
        polyline points=projection_path fill="none" stroke=line_color stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 4" stroke-linejoin="round"
      - step_markers.each do |marker|
        circle cx=marker[:x] cy=marker[:y] r="3.5" fill="white" stroke=line_color stroke-width="2" data-balance-point=""
      - if (low = lowest_marker)
        circle cx=low[:x] cy=low[:y] r="6" fill="#eac20b" stroke=line_color stroke-width="2" data-balance-lowest=""
        text x=low[:x] y=(low[:below] ? low[:y] + 22 : low[:y] - 12) text-anchor=low[:anchor] font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill=line_color
          = low[:label]
      / Le repère du point survolé, déplacé par `balance-chart`.
      g visibility="hidden" pointer-events="none" data-balance-chart-target="cursor"
        line x1="0" y1="8" x2="0" y2=baseline stroke=line_color stroke-width="1" stroke-opacity="0.35" data-balance-chart-target="guide"
        circle cx="0" cy="0" r="5.5" fill=line_color stroke="white" stroke-width="2" data-balance-chart-target="dot"
      / Toute la surface du graphe capte la souris : le point visé est le plus proche en abscisse.
      rect x=axis_width y="0" width=(width - axis_width) height=baseline fill="transparent"
  p.mt-2.flex.flex-wrap.gap-x-8.gap-y-2.text-xs.text-stone-500
    span.inline-flex.items-center.gap-2
      svg width="24" height="6" aria-hidden="true"
        line x1="0" y1="3" x2="24" y2="3" stroke=line_color stroke-width="2"
      | Solde réel
    span.inline-flex.items-center.gap-2
      svg width="24" height="6" aria-hidden="true"
        line x1="0" y1="3" x2="24" y2="3" stroke=line_color stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 4"
      | Projection
    span.text-stone-400 Survoler la courbe : solde et mouvements de chaque jour.
